 "readmeHTML": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"docs/README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"./mmrs.svg\"><img src=\"./mmrs.svg\" alt=\"An implementation of a metamodule\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Magic Mount Metamodule</h1><a id=\"user-content-magic-mount-metamodule\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Magic Mount Metamodule\" href=\"#magic-mount-metamodule\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://t.me/mmrs_ci\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/1a90162d91a0f7595cedba100129da3b1fe18d64828b3f480038decfc866aec1/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f47726f75702d626c75653f7374796c653d666f722d7468652d6261646765266c6f676f3d74656c656772616d266c6162656c3d54656c656772616d\" alt=\"Telegram\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Group-blue?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=telegram&amp;label=Telegram\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/4ecf48530b6f7f5a1f4bea57e7477a92845dcbd24b255ae5f1a5eda2181012a7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f72656c656173652f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72733f6c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"Version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs?logo=github\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/99c90a585f9d698f54170fed72ab65874a294b322cb3385f611c37d7facba9f7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72732f746f74616c3f6c6f676f3d676974687562266c6f676f436f6c6f723d677265656e\" alt=\"GitHub Downloads\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/total?logo=github&amp;logoColor=green\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"README_en.md\">English</a> <a href=\"README_ru.md\">Русский</a></p>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">为 KernelSU/APatch 提供 Systemless 修改功能。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">作者由于学业原因，更新会放缓</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">配置</h2><a id=\"user-content-配置\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 配置\" href=\"#配置\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">配置文件路径：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>/data/adb/magic_mount/config.toml</code></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-toml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mountsource = &quot;KSU&quot;\numount = false\npartitions = []\nextra_mount = []\"><pre><span class=\"pl-smi\">mountsource</span> = <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>KSU<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">umount</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">partitions</span> = []\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">extra_mount</span> = []</pre></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>mountsource</td>\n<td>Systemless 挂载来源标识。默认值 \"KSU\" 与 KernelSU 行为保持一致。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>umount</td>\n<td>是否尝试卸载（依赖 KernelSU umount ）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partitions</td>\n<td>指定需要进行 Systemless 操作的特定分区列表，例如 \"mi_ext\",\"my_stock\" 等。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>extra_mount</code> 默认 <code>[]</code>。例如 <code>extra_mount = [\"my_product\"]</code> 将 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/my_product/</code> 内容合并挂载到 <code>/my_product/</code>，不从 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/system/my_product/</code> 读取。要求目标目录已存在，且 <code>/system/my_product</code> 完全没有目录项（包括悬空符号链接）。只填写单级分区名，不填写路径；无效条目记录日志并跳过。没有 <code>system/</code> 的模块也受支持，仍遵循 <code>disable</code>、<code>remove</code> 和 <code>skip_mount</code> 标记。编辑配置后重启生效。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">也可通过 WEBUI 配置页修改（推荐）；MiuiX 和 MD3 均提供“额外挂载分区（模块顶层）”编辑控件，支持添加和删除 <code>extra_mount</code> 分区名。保存后重启生效。</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">自定义规则</h2><a id=\"user-content-自定义规则\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 自定义规则\" href=\"#自定义规则\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">规则文件：<code>/data/adb/magic_mount/custom</code></p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# 忽略某个模块来源文件\nignore /data/adb/modules/example/system/app/Example.apk\n\n# 将来源只读 bind 到目标\nbind &quot;/data/local/tmp/source file&quot; &quot;/system/etc/target file&quot;\n\n# 递归包含其他规则文件；add 与 file 语义相同\nfile /data/adb/magic_mount/extra.rules\nadd /data/adb/magic_mount/more.rules\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code># 忽略某个模块来源文件\nignore /data/adb/modules/example/system/app/Example.apk\n\n# 将来源只读 bind 到目标\nbind \"/data/local/tmp/source file\" \"/system/etc/target file\"\n\n# 递归包含其他规则文件；add 与 file 语义相同\nfile /data/adb/magic_mount/extra.rules\nadd /data/adb/magic_mount/more.rules\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">规则支持单引号、双引号、包含空白的路径和行尾注释。控制字符会被过滤；递归 include\n使用独立 visited 集合，因此循环引用不会无限递归。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">自定义 bind 的目标必须是绝对路径，不能包含 <code>..</code>。目标不存在时，程序会从最近存在的\n非根祖先构造临时镜像；任意 remount 或登记失败都会 detach 回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">开发</h2><a id=\"user-content-开发\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 开发\" href=\"#开发\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">依赖：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rust nightly toolchain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Android NDK</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cargo-ndk</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Node.js / npm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>pnpm</code> and <code>vite</code> as dependency and frontend for webui</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">环境变量：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export ANDROID_NDK_HOME=&lt;path/to/ndk&gt;\nexport ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=$ANDROID_NDK_HOME\n\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_HOME=<span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>path/to/ndk<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$ANDROID_NDK_HOME</span>\n</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cargo xtask build\"><pre>cargo xtask build</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建产物将位于：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>output/magic_mount_rs-*.zip</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">致谢</h2><a id=\"user-content-致谢\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 致谢\" href=\"#致谢\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/5ec1cff/KernelSU/blob/52f1f575ce2bd0ca46ebf644fd00a838af9f344e/userspace/ksud/src/magic_mount.rs\">5ec1cff/KernelSU</a>：原始实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/YuzakiKokuban\">YuzakiKokuban</a> Webui修改</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">许可证</h2><a id=\"user-content-许可证\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 许可证\" href=\"#许可证\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-v3 许可证</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Star History</h2><a id=\"user-content-star-history\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Star History\" href=\"#star-history\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://star-history.dera.page/#Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/020d466668c08b899057c56d77c9c6e28bfbe8e9fe5c437736e355676da5db1a/68747470733a2f2f737461722d686973746f72792e646572612e706167652f7376673f7265706f733d546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d7273267468656d653d6461726b\" data-canonical-src=\"https://star-history.dera.page/svg?repos=Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs&amp;theme=dark\">\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/286bdc0354291aee4108ad848f8f1aa0527f3dcc74b8749d9abeebc73b1af65f/68747470733a2f2f737461722d686973746f72792e646572612e706167652f7376673f7265706f733d546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d7273\" data-canonical-src=\"https://star-history.dera.page/svg?repos=Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs\">\n   <img alt=\"Star History Chart\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/286bdc0354291aee4108ad848f8f1aa0527f3dcc74b8749d9abeebc73b1af65f/68747470733a2f2f737461722d6869737