   "descriptionHTML": "<h2>What's Changed in 4.0.11</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>agent: sync last changes by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a></li>\n<li>webui: add extra_mount editor to configuration pages by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a></li>\n<li>mount: add extra_mount for top-level module partitions by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a></li>\n<li>parser: refactor parser by lexparser by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a></li>\n<li>bot: refine run finding logic, and add backup path by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/originalFactor/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/originalFactor\">@originalFactor</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/190\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/190/hovercard\">#190</a></li>\n<li>cli: replace parser by clap by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hov